@startuml deployment-diagram
title BrewLite – Sơ đồ triển khai production (Vercel + Render + Neon)

node "Thiết bị người dùng\n(trình duyệt / mobile)" as Browser {
  [Next.js UI\nmobile-first] as WebApp
}

node "Vercel\n(CDN + Edge, HTTPS)" as Vercel {
  [Next.js App Router\nbuild tĩnh/SSR] as FE
}

node "Render (Free, Singapore)\nDocker container từ apps/api/Dockerfile" as Render {
  [NestJS API\n/api/v1] as API
  [Cron hủy đơn quá hạn\n@nestjs/schedule] as Cron
  [Prisma Client] as Prisma
}

database "Neon PostgreSQL\n(Singapore, SSL, không public)" as DB

cloud "ZaloPay Sandbox" as ZLP {
  [Create / Query / Cancel API] as ZLPAPI
  [Callback HTTPS] as ZLPCB
}

cloud "GitHub" as GH {
  [Repository\nmain] as Repo
  [GitHub Actions\nCI: lint, test, build] as CI
}

Browser --> FE : HTTPS
FE --> API : HTTPS JSON + JWT\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
API --> Prisma
Prisma --> DB : TCP 5432 + SSL
API --> ZLPAPI : HTTPS\nHMAC-SHA256
ZLPCB --> API : POST /api/v1/payments/zalopay/callback\n(verify MAC key2)
Cron --> DB

Repo --> CI : push / pull_request (main)
CI --> Repo : kết quả quality gate
Repo --> Render : auto-deploy khi main thay đổi\n(Render GitHub App, build Docker)
Repo --> Vercel : auto-deploy khi main thay đổi\n(Vercel Git integration)

note right of Render
  Biến môi trường đặt trong Render Dashboard
  (DATABASE_URL, JWT_SECRET, ZALOPAY_KEY*).
  Không có secret trong repository hay log CI.
  Health check: GET /api/v1/health.
end note

note bottom of DB
  Migration: prisma migrate deploy (forward-only).
  Backup: Neon point-in-time recovery.
  Rollback ứng dụng: redeploy commit/tag trước trên Render/Vercel.
end note

note top of CI
  Ranh giới: local (Docker Compose) – CI (PostgreSQL service) – production.
  CI dùng database tạm, không gọi mạng ZaloPay.
end note

@enduml
